					"name": "Enhanced Move (Ground)",
					"reference": "B52",
					"local_notes": "Top sprinting speed x1.5. Combat Move unchanged.\n\nLore: Aeldari run with a lightness and speed no human can match; in the fiction they cross open ground before an enemy can bring guns to bear.\n\nDesign: Enhanced Move (Ground) 1/2 (B52, half level 10) at the user's direction, matching the Astartes half level.",
