							"id": "tKttlN9EezFY2V5l2",
							"name": "Enhance",
							"local_notes": "Lore: A surge of psychically-lent strength or speed into a willing ally's limbs.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10) delivering a +10 point ST/DX-boosting advantage (+10% per point, B36: +100%), Warp Sorcery (-20%), Perils (Aeldari Runes, -5%). Net +75%. Full modified cost: 17.5, rounded up to 18 points (discounted to a fifth as the cheaper alternative ability, so the container costs 19 + 4 = 23); needs Aeldari Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20) at its full-price rate.",
							"tags": [
