							"name": "Drain",
							"local_notes": "Lore: Saps the strength or endurance straight out of an enemy's limbs.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10) delivering a -10 point ST/DX/FP-draining disadvantage, Malediction (+100%), Warp Sorcery (-20%), Perils (Aeldari Runes, -5%). Net +85%. Full modified cost: 18.5, rounded to 19 points (the costlier child, so it sets the container's cap requirement); needs Aeldari Warp Empowerment level 1 (cap 20).",
