			"name": "Aspect: Howling Banshee",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The fastest Aspect: duelists whose war masks howl a shriek that unsteadies an enemy line half a heartbeat before the blades arrive.\n\nDesign: Net 7 points, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
