					"local_notes": "Lore: A Banshee's blade-work is a dance of paired, mirrored strokes.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Broadsword (the Banshee's power sword; Exarchs fight with paired Mirrorswords or the Executioner instead).",
