		{
			"id": "T8dtgl6nGP0vaHrrg",
			"name": "Aspect: Fire Dragon",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Close-assault tank hunters who close to point-blank range with a fusion gun and burn through anything short of a Titan.\n\nDesign: Net 3 points, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
